lines:
You’re...
Ah, you must be {0100:0}, right?{be01}
Thank you for playing with Wally a
little while ago.{be01}
He’s been frail and sickly ever
since he was a baby.{be01}
We’ve sent him to stay with my relatives
in Verdanturf Town for a while.{be01}
The air is a lot cleaner there
than it is here.{be01}
What’s that? Where’s Wally?
He’s already left, our Wally.{be01}
I wonder where he could have
gotten by now?

{0100:0}！原谅我们这样拉你过来，但是，自
从我家满充去了绿茵镇之后，他的身{be01}
体好多了。我们都欠你的情！满充离
开镇子前，是你陪他捕捉了一只宝可{be01}
梦对吗？我想那让满充非常开心。实
际上，不只是满充，作为父亲的我也{be01}
很开心，很开心他能交上你这样的好
朋友。这点礼物虽然不算什么但还是{be01}
请你收下。

I want you to keep this a secret
from my husband...{be01}
But our Wally left Verdanturf Town
without telling anyone.{be01}
You know, Wally is frail, but
he’s surprisingly strong-willed.{be01}
I’m sure that he’ll come back safe
and sound one day!
